sYU8Ca_btmAQ7kNvwF0QAmq&_nc_oc=Adp9EPBs6swvF8VNPwVJVIygiN-_1fBWhksLUBNoThphuK95Ry1igQRvwkdyal9PpcU&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQFyfWsBVFmaV6rZwaugdItKtbNwu9MCo8E_B5uVgQTRIw&oe=6A831737"}, {"file_name": "04.png", "id": "771918482106759", "uri": "https://scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499619465_771918485440092_2131832106720639880_n.png?_nc_cat=108&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=P0dl2BaCzNIQ7kNvwHsyPkW&_nc_oc=AdrNTtdg5d4GJ1zUWcQVQO4cgKSuINwdJpIjLyqr2UxVfQ7YTxxs-j9PniX-4kSl-0c&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQG3HDVXYFG5KXtgQZuJXFWYAk6HORWmAW4sBQmQzEi2pQ&oe=6A8318CA"}, {"file_name": "05.png", "id": "24094775356867679", "uri": "https://scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499298543_24094775363534345_8848995430294496546_n.png?_nc_cat=102&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=mGaQ-U_69agQ7kNvwETbGE-&_nc_oc=Adq7ogZ9eHVySkP7KBdSMdVDyGVdneXDLn5BAM61weG-9ffHT5FWcnVXGRU2Ph4An4s&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQGqCOLUZjJkqh6Vtf04_8c3OnsGYM1QS8gOX9rpLTLi1Q&oe=6A8305EF"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": null, "display_name": "MOKNVG", "keywords": ["Nightvision", "NVG"], "long_description": "# Simulated Night Vision Experience\nThe MOKNVG simulates dummy night vision effect with realistic device operations, offering an immersive and interactive experience.\n\n**Features**\n- Customizable dummy NVG effect (with color adjustment)\n- Fully interactable NVG device functions\n- Supports both controller and hand interactions\n- Adjustable focus effect and DoF center mask for aiming with optics(Quest 3 only)\n\n**Interactable Controls**\n- Flip-down\n- Forward / Back adjustment\n- Side flip rotation\n- Left / Right switch\n- Pod power switch\n- Focus control\n- Manual gain control\n\n**Current available NVG type**\n- Monocular  NVG\n\n**Notice**\n- Current camera input has a 40\u201360 ms delay\n-  Input image is not fully accurate due to limitations in the API used during app development\n\n- Play safe and watch your surroundings!\n\n**Requred Device** \n- Quest 3 / Quest 3S\n- Must be running Horizon OS v74 or higher", "short_description": "MOKNVG simulates dummy night vision effect with realistic device operations, offering an immersive and interactive experience."}, {"images": {"nodes": [{"file_name": "Logo_01.png", "id": "24692493507105236", "image_type": "APP_IMG_LOGO_TRANSPARENT", "uri": "https://scontent-sjc3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491825041_24692493510438569_5662868901094719245_n.png?_nc_cat=105&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=VWMa4c80HfEQ7kNvwHN3hXK&_nc_oc=AdrQVUYMwSupED-7PLLnFe_graV7NMukxs1jNZv5SZ346ztrVUzUAclD4raZR39wAA8&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQGG2tIZPQcNjyQfAV7nSMjef8avscFrh8yksjjfPa8oBg&oe=6A82EF43"}, {"file_name": "Cover_Landscape_2560x1440_01.png", "id": "1831122448283491", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_LANDSCAPE", "uri": "https://scontent-sjc3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499618984_1831122454950157_3916287305954730484_n.png?_nc_cat=103&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=sJKTPsraG94Q7kNvwF8qjGO&_nc_oc=AdoM7Z5n3mzy-nb1hN4h2Kgci15nShxozTU5CGUgiIwg3T5dH2SLBqzw_FhmpQF-XGs&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQHkZ-b0R8Wnh6j6Y4kBiSrNaDr5_S4lakGbDXX8jpdkQg&oe=6A82E798"}, {"file_name": "Icon_512x512.png", "id": "1686371038722132", "image_type": "APP_IMG_ICON", "uri": "https://scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491831798_1686371042055465_2000336760327949752_n.png?_nc_cat=107&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=i53chw62BIEQ7kNvwGYrffQ&_nc_oc=AdqD3rB833dbCEKKBlFuNimD18yotHnDBjMNgDUuRHdAdCIPoIxFeGWaWqE6B14uxOE&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQG2hQTs9he5phrOeoOC-zhcwLhHII-VYyFgcL0VQrzTcw&oe=6A82FABC"}, {"file_name": "Cover_Square_1440x1440_01.png", "id": "1338680584514953", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_SQUARE", "uri": "https://scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499619594_1338680587848286_62080